sequenceDiagram
    actor SuperAdmin
    participant Browser
    participant MVC as AdminManagementController
    participant Svc as AdminService
    participant UserMgr as UserManager
    participant RoleMgr as RoleManager
    participant DB as SQL Server

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: Open AdminManagement/Create
    Browser->>MVC: GET Create
    MVC-->>Browser: CreateAdminViewModel form

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: Enter name email password roles
    Browser->>MVC: POST Create
    MVC->>MVC: Validate ModelState

    alt Validation failed
        MVC-->>Browser: Form with errors
    else Valid input
        MVC->>Svc: CreateAdmin(model)
        Svc->>UserMgr: CreateAsync(ApplicationUser, password)
        UserMgr->>DB: INSERT AspNetUsers
        DB-->>UserMgr: user Id

        loop For each selected role
            Svc->>RoleMgr: RoleExistsAsync(roleName)
            Svc->>UserMgr: AddToRoleAsync(user, roleName)
            UserMgr->>DB: INSERT AspNetUserRoles
        end

        UserMgr-->>Svc: IdentityResult Succeeded
        Svc-->>MVC: Succeeded
        MVC-->>Browser: Redirect AdminManagement/Index
        Browser-->>SuperAdmin: Updated user list
    end

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: Open ManageRoles for user
    Browser->>MVC: GET ManageRoles(id)
    MVC->>Svc: GetRoleAssignmentModel(id)
    Svc->>UserMgr: GetRolesAsync(user)
    UserMgr->>DB: SELECT roles
    MVC-->>Browser: Role checkboxes

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: POST updated roles
    Browser->>MVC: POST ManageRoles
    MVC->>Svc: UpdateRoles(model)
    Svc->>UserMgr: Remove and add roles
    UserMgr->>DB: UPDATE AspNetUserRoles
    MVC-->>Browser: Redirect Index
